      "text": "Way to bury the lede! Earlier today, Border Patrol removed two violent criminals from a Chicago suburb school.\n\nAgents were pursuing the two Mexican nationals as part of Operation Midway Blitz, when they fled into the school.\n\nIt’s a great thing our agents caught them.\n\nJosafat Garcia-Roa: Multiple DUIs, felony cocaine possession, multiple domestic batteries and assaults, violation of bail bond.\n\nSamuel Suarez-Cuevas: Kidnapping, multiple counts of domestic violence and domestic battery, criminal damage. \n\nCBP is committed to removing criminal illegal aliens from our country.",
